  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "ULN2003 stepper driver board",
  "category": "power",
  "description": "The common ULN2003 stepper motor driver board sold with the 28BYJ-48: IN1 to IN4 to a ULN2003A, its outputs on the 5-pin motor connector (pin 5 to + through the ON/OFF jumper), and an LED (A to D) on each output that lights while the channel sinks, showing the stepping sequence.",
