      "claims": "The common ULN2003 stepper driver board: a ULN2003A with inputs IN1 to IN4 on the header, its outputs 1 to 4 on the motor connector's pins 1 to 4, + to COM and to connector pin 5 through the fitted ON/OFF jumper, and four LEDs (A to D) with 1 kOhm from + to the outputs, lit while an output sinks.",
      "omissions": [
        "the ON/OFF jumper (always fitted)",
        "the ULN2003's inputs 5 to 7 (unused on the board)",
        "the LEDs' colour and brightness spread between boards"
      ],
